            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "McClung, Madison Grace (2018). Why You Need Women In Your Corner: An analysis of gender representation at music labels on the executive level. Unpublished Honors Thesis. Stanford University, Stanford CA.",
